#: ../../source/outgoing/csp.rst:99
msgid ""
"CSP Level 3 deprecates the ``report-uri`` directive in favor of ``report-"
"to``. Therefore, you can use the ``setReportToEndpoint()`` method to set "
"the reporting endpoint for CSP reports. Before adding this directive, "
"make sure the reporting endpoints are already defined using the "
"``addReportingEndpoints()`` method."
