#: ../../source/outgoing/csp.rst:120
msgid "Inline Content"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/outgoing/csp.rst:122
msgid ""
"It is possible to set a website to not protect even inline scripts and "
"styles on its own pages, since this might have been the result of user-"
"generated content. To protect against this, CSP allows you to specify a "
"nonce within the ``<style>`` and ``<script>`` tags, and to add those "
"values to the response's header."
msgstr ""

